    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "n1",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 470,
      "text": "a commit is a SNAPSHOT plus parents, not a diff. Once you believe that, merge and rebase stop being scary: one adds a node, the other builds new nodes and moves the label.",
